    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Narrative intent:\nThis chapter establishes the Ethereal Realm’s caretakers (six Aeon Keepers), confirms Earth’s returning habitability, reveals the Pelagor survived in transformed form, and commits to manifesting Neferati as autonomous intermediaries.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "01_the_ethereal_vigil",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "01_the_ethereal_vigil",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "World-state changes:",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Earth’s geomantic networks stabilize toward habitability (tectonics, atmosphere, water coverage).",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "01_the_ethereal_vigil",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Pelagor confirmed alive but transformed; strong abilities, weak framework/knowledge.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "01_the_ethereal_vigil",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "01_the_ethereal_vigil",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Decision: manifest 1,000 Neferati simultaneously, intended as purpose-driven but autonomous builders.",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "01_the_ethereal_vigil",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "Cast/entities introduced:",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "Aeon Keepers: Lyaris, Theron, Vaelith, Mordain, Syreth, Korath.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "01_the_ethereal_vigil",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "Pelagor (transformed survivors).",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "01_the_ethereal_vigil",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "Neferati (to be manifested).",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "01_the_ethereal_vigil",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "Canonical terms introduced (starter set):",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "Ethereal Realm (between thought and form).",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "01_the_ethereal_vigil",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "Akashic Records (library orbiting as knowledge bridge).",
